  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  # Ajax legacy write endpoints
  
  Session-cookie protected `POST` endpoints from `RoadizRozierBundle` `Controller/Ajax/*`.
  Unlike the API Platform endpoints, these are **not** JWT-based: they need the Rozier
  backoffice **session cookie** and a **CSRF token** bound to that session.
  
  Bodies are `application/x-www-form-urlencoded`, exactly as the Rozier frontend sends them
  (`new URLSearchParams(...)`).
  
  ## Required variables (Local Dev environment)
  
  - `admin_cookie` — the whole `Cookie` header value of a logged-in backoffice session.
    Grab it from your browser DevTools (Network tab, any `/rz-admin/ajax/...` request → request
    header `Cookie`), e.g. `PHPSESSID=...; REMEMBERME=...`.
  - `ajaxToken` — the CSRF token for the `rozier_ajax` intention. In the backoffice, open the
    browser console and run `window.RozierConfig.ajaxToken`. It stays valid for the session.
  
  Both are session-scoped: refresh them together when the session expires.
}
